        ["Can we talk about ammunition?"] = "¿Podemos hablar de municiones?",
        ["*If you haven't previously upgraded your cape*"] = "*Si no has mejorado tu capa previamente*",
        ["No, not making it! You see, I helped create a device that returns my ammunition."] = "¡No, no lo lograré! Verás, ayudé a crear un dispositivo que devuelve mis municiones.",
        ["*If you have one of Ava's devices in your inventory*"] = "*Si tienes uno de los dispositivos de Ava en tu inventario*",
