        ["What's that, Zimberfizz? You think you saw Nomad do something like that before?"] = "¿Qué es eso, Zimberfizz? ¿Crees que viste a Nomad hacer algo así antes?",
        ["So this will only work in Soul Wars? That's better than nothing. Thanks!"] = "¿Entonces esto solo funcionará en Soul Wars? Eso es mejor que nada. ¡Gracias!",
        ["*If you don't have any of Ava's devices in your inventory*"] = "*Si no tienes ninguno de los dispositivos de Ava en tu inventario*",
        ["Hmm, I'll have to go and see Ava in Draynor Manor, to see about getting a replacement."] = "Hmm, tendré que ir a ver Ava en Draynor Manor para ver si consiguen un reemplazo.",
        ["*If you have previously upgraded your cape*"] = "*Si has mejorado tu capa previamente*",
